verses:
The true mighty power that cometh
from seven skies,
The true mighty power that cometh
from seven skies,
It is a mighty power,
It is mighty power,
The true mighty power that cometh
from seven skies,
It is a victory power for us all.

The God Almighty Thou art the hope
for mankind,
Chorus: Provide for us all.

The God Almighty Thou art the hope
for mankind,
Chorus: Provide for us all.
